2 & 28\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce $M$ to row echelon form, and then find the general solution of the linear system represented by the matrix." :question/worked-solution "Reducing $M$ to echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 7 \\\\ 4 & -12 & 28\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-4{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x-3y=7 \\\\ 0x+0y=0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince any pair of numbers $x,y$ is a solution of the final equation $0x+0y=0,$ we can remove this equation from the system. So, our system now consists of a single equation\n\n$$\nx-3y=7.\n$$\n\nThe first variable $(x)$ is the basic variable, and the second variable $(y)$ is the free variable. Solving for the basic variable $(x)$ in terms of the free variable $(y),$ we get $x=7+3y,$ and the general solution is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x=7+3y \\\\ y=y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $y$ is an arbitrary number. \n\nIn vector form, the general solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}7+3y \\\\ y\\end{aligned}],\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-20958/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "97cd9132-458b-5234-a3d2-22b633acb74c"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-20958"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130923/selection/26f64d864a53c49e4ee2477b7f86b1e7e2f421267906dfb9efc0c24791d377d4" :answer/id #uuid "f08aee29-d635-5a36-8dc2-2e6082fcdb62" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-2y-1 \\\\ y\\end{aligned}],\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130923/selection/6d6811ceb4fb69a54ce1b24e6804e5f0148bafa1b76b847b06436eb966d36b67" :answer/id #uuid "f4a99e56-614c-5c40-a70a-dc986e138a3b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "No solution" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130923/selection/bcdf90440f57627a8de1a89f3923fe726760f7f610ed6126aecc4f7e4a1fa3cc" :answer/id #uuid "0876b98f-b15c-56f4-ab14-4427e5b26dcd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}2y-1 \\\\ y\\end{aligned}],\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130923/selection/b281b0c65b28852a265e45d86efbe0f872541b03035b263e65e84f5f30e8f7a0" :answer/id #uuid "1dfd9d13-3564-53de-a254-ff7c3a73fbda" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1-2y \\\\ y\\end{aligned}],\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130923/selection/c16f73c6dcd2feff45d079ef404d7c8b47cf8f04221ee0cbcf38ede15c995ec9" :answer/id #uuid "eb49d7ca-5515-5bc3-8ed9-29b0b18758de" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}2-y \\\\ y\\end{aligned}],\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130923/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "6ae3b192-27d3-5a52-b4a6-108fa9bcc17c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-130923/selection/6d6811ceb4fb69a54ce1b24e6804e5f0148bafa1b76b847b06436eb966d36b67" :answer-field/choices ["q-130923/selection/26f64d864a53c49e4ee2477b7f86b1e7e2f421267906dfb9efc0c24791d377d4" "q-130923/selection/6d6811ceb4fb69a54ce1b24e6804e5f0148bafa1b76b847b06436eb966d36b67" "q-130923/selection/bcdf90440f57627a8de1a89f3923fe726760f7f610ed6126aecc4f7e4a1fa3cc" "q-130923/selection/b281b0c65b28852a265e45d86efbe0f872541b03035b263e65e84f5f30e8f7a0" "q-130923/selection/c16f73c6dcd2feff45d079ef404d7c8b47cf8f04221ee0cbcf38ede15c995ec9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-130923" :question/id #uuid "d891d6e7-8e53-5283-b451-783d6b61c60e" :question/math-academy-id "q-130923" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x-2y=-1 \\\\ -4x+8y=7.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form, and then find the general solution of the linear system." :question/worked-solution "First, we set up the augmented matrix for the system:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & -1 \\\\ -4 & 8 & 7\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nReducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & -1 \\\\ -4 & 8 & 7\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+4{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x-2y=-1 \\\\ 0x+0y=3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHowever, the final equation $0x+0y=3$ has no solution. It simplifies to $0=3,$ which is a false statement.\n\nSo, there is no pair $x,y$ that satisfies both equations in the system. Consequently, the overall system has no solution." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-130923/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "07f2ae4c-ff07-5b99-a7b0-90f460081eef"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130923"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} [:db/retract 17592186106245 :question/answer-fields 17592186103979] {:db/id "q-42167/selection/ma-v1/f7be60c5b940d1f901d5f73f9e5def26db94145d2d03a7218335a1def81fb1c2/6d6811ceb4fb69a54ce1b24e6804e5f0148bafa1b76b847b06436eb966d36b67" :answer/id #uuid "4b9b069d-f35b-5ad4-a507-f9504f89fc4a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "No solution" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42167/selection/ma-v1/f7be60c5b940d1f901d5f73f9e5def26db94145d2d03a7218335a1def81fb1c2/a9c61c6f10b1e577ed71468d22767159a20a9fe7856dd5dabfb69789eba772d1" :answer/id #uuid "477679fb-5b91-5659-9579-bef7bbe94a46" :answer/